      "text": "Functioncal Requiremetns\n- Able to rate limit by user_id, IP address or API key\n- Rule are configurable\n- Return proper error code(429) and status header",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Functioncal Requiremetns\n- Able to rate limit by user_id, IP address or API key\n- Rule are configurable\n- Return proper error code(429) and status header",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
