      "updated": 1781094971888,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Rate limit check from API gateways vs Check from Back-end apps\n-> we should do the rate limit check from the api gatways itself as this will save our back-end service from\nDDOS attack.\n\nDeep dive on the Rate limiter Design.\nLet say we need allow 100 request per minutes per user\n\n\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Rate limit check from API gateways vs Check from Back-end apps\n-> we should do the rate limit check from the api gatways itself as this will save our back-end service from\nDDOS attack.\n\nDeep dive on the Rate limiter Design.\nLet say we need allow 100 request per minutes per user\n\n\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
