    {
      "id": "L8HLZgmb2v6esR_AGgHsU",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 508.0031051635742,
      "y": 1028.845703125,
      "width": 757.5595092773438,
      "height": 475,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aS",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1817431565,
      "version": 839,
      "versionNonce": 2019621332,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1781104541208,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Option 1 -> flexible window, token bucket\n \nUser_id ->  request count, last request time\n\nWhen new request arrived read the request count\n\nis allowd =  (request count < 100 && currnet time - last request time < 1 min)\n                or (currnet time - last request time > 1 min)\nwhen the currnet time - last request time > 1 min, reset the request count=1\nelse request count+=1\n\n1001 -> 12:59, ctr=99 -> Request 99 -> current time 12:59, allowed\n1001 -> 12:59, ctr=100 -> Request 100 -> current time 12:59, allowed\n1001 -> 12:59, ctr=100 -> Request 101 -> current time 12:59 , denied\n1001 -> 1:00, ctr=100 -> Request 102 -> current time 1:00 , denied\nIt will never allowed the API, if user is trying call the API in every seconds\n\n\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Option 1 -> flexible window, token bucket\n \nUser_id ->  request count, last request time\n\nWhen new request arrived read the request count\n\nis allowd =  (request count < 100 && currnet time - last request time < 1 min)\n                or (currnet time - last request time > 1 min)\nwhen the currnet time - last request time > 1 min, reset the request count=1\nelse request count+=1\n\n1001 -> 12:59, ctr=99 -> Request 99 -> current time 12:59, allowed\n1001 -> 12:59, ctr=100 -> Request 100 -> current time 12:59, allowed\n1001 -> 12:59, ctr=100 -> Request 101 -> current time 12:59 , denied\n1001 -> 1:00, ctr=100 -> Request 102 -> current time 1:00 , denied\nIt will never allowed the API, if user is trying call the API in every seconds\n\n\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "VYJtkpXKR_M4fFEB9uM6Q",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 225.73357391357422,
      "y": 1445.779296875,
      "width": 806.2994384765625,
      "height": 225,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
